msgid "Forecast Lookahead (hours)"
msgstr ""

#: functions/custom_functions/env_coordinator_impl/_function_info.py:1002
msgid ""
"How many hours ahead to check for incoming adverse weather (1–6 h). Longer "
"lookahead gives earlier warning but may over-correct."
msgstr ""

#: functions/custom_functions/env_coordinator_impl/_function_info.py:1065
msgid "Control Temperament"
msgstr ""

#: functions/custom_functions/env_coordinator_impl/_function_info.py:1067
msgid ""
"How hard the system chases the target. Sets the cycle, how often vents may "
"move, the dead-band and the emergency thresholds together."
msgstr ""

#: functions/custom_functions/env_coordinator_impl/_function_info.py:1127
msgid "Ventilation and HVAC Teamwork"
msgstr ""

#: functions/custom_functions/env_coordinator_impl/_function_info.py:1134
msgid ""
"Keeps venting and HVAC from working against each other. At [Energy saving] "
"the HVAC rests when venting alone can reach the target, and the vents close "
"while it runs. At [High performance] both act freely so the target is "
"reached sooner."
msgstr ""

#: functions/custom_functions/env_coordinator_impl/_function_info.py:1139
